  When you pray, you fall somewhat from the graces of your god because
he has to do you a favor.  If you #offer right after that, you might
have a hopeful feeling.  Keep #offering, and you'll go though several
different stages. After the hopeful feeling, you'll have a
reconciliation.  At that time, you could #pray again if you needed
some healing, or something.  Instead, try to keep #offering corpses.
You'll see four-leafed clovers at your feet.  Guess what that means.
After a while, you'll get lucky enough so that you're god'll give
you something good.

